fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstlcevcmeta.html#gst_buffer_get_lcevc_meta_id","fragment":"\n\tgst_buffer_get_lcevc_meta_id\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.buffer_get_lcevc_meta_id\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.buffer_get_lcevc_meta_id\n\nFind the GstLcevcMeta on buffer with the given id.\nBuffers can contain multiple GstLcevcMeta metadata items when dealing with\nmultiview buffers.\nParameters:\na GstBuffer\na metadata id\nthe GstLcevcMeta with id or NULL when there is no such metadata\non buffer.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nFind the GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta on buffer with the given id.\nBuffers can contain multiple GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta metadata items when dealing with\nmultiview buffers.\nParameters:\na Gst.Buffer\na metadata id\nthe GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta with id or null when there is no such metadata\non buffer.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nFind the GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta on buffer with the given id.\nBuffers can contain multiple GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta metadata items when dealing with\nmultiview buffers.\nParameters:\na Gst.Buffer\na metadata id\nthe GstCodecParsers.LcevcMeta with id or None when there is no such metadata\non buffer.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});